		"devdoc": {
			"details": "Minimal interface for the already-deployed ArcenticMultiPool contract.      NOTE: ArcenticMultiPool does NOT mint a transferable LP token — `lpBalance`      is an internal mapping keyed by whoever called addLiquidity(). Because of      that, this vault must itself be the depositor of record in the pool: it      pulls each user's principal, forwards it into the pool via addLiquidity()      (so it becomes real, tradable reserve liquidity), and tracks each user's      share/lock/reward entirely in its own storage.",
